<h2><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Mask_questions">Mask questions</span>=
</h2>
<p>Due to a lack of a better term, we define all questions where the input =
of answers is predefined as <i>mask questions</i>.
</p><p><br>
</p>
<h3><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Date">Date</span></h3>
<div style=3D"display:none;">&lt;translate&gt;
</div>
<p>This question type can be used to ask for a certain date, time or a comb=
ination of both date and time. The values can be selected by the participan=
ts either from a popup calendar or from <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.o=
rg/manual/Question_type_-_Date#Display_dropdown_boxes_(dropdown_dates)" tit=
le=3D"Question type - Date">dropdown boxes</a>. <a href=3D"https://www.lime=
survey.org/manual/Question_type_-_Date#Question_validation_equation_(em_val=
idation_q)" title=3D"Question type - Date">Validation</a>, <a href=3D"https=
://www.limesurvey.org/manual/Question_type_-_Date#Minimum_date_(date_min)" =
title=3D"Question type - Date">minimum</a>, and/or <a href=3D"https://www.l=
imesurvey.org/manual/Question_type_-_Date#Maximum_date_(date_max)" title=3D=
"Question type - Date">maximum dates</a> can be chosen by the survey admini=
strator. Various date and time formats <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.or=
g/manual/Question_type_-_Date#Date/Time_format" title=3D"Question type - Da=
te">are supported</a>.
</p>
<center><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https=
://www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:Timepicker.jpg" class=3D"mw-file-descript=
ion"><img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/4/40/Timepicker.j=
pg" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"308" height=3D"328" class=3D"mw-file-elemen=
t"></a></span><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D=
"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:D_Date_DD.jpg" class=3D"mw-file-des=
cription"><img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/1/14/D_Date_=
DD.jpg" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"282" height=3D"127" class=3D"mw-file-el=
ement"></a></span>
<p><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https://ww=
w.limesurvey.org/manual/File:Datetime.jpg" class=3D"mw-file-description"><i=
mg src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/c/c0/Datetime.jpg" decod=
ing=3D"async" width=3D"556" height=3D"371" class=3D"mw-file-element"></a></=
span>
</p>
</center>
