</p><p><br>
</p>
<h3><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"File_upload">File upload</span></h3>
<p>The file upload question type can be used to collect file(s) from a user=
 in response to a question. For example, a company with employment opportun=
ities could use this question type to request the candidate to submit/uploa=
d his or her updated CV, as well as any other scanned documents in the empl=
oyment survey.
</p>
<center><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https=
://www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:File-upload-screenshot.png" class=3D"mw-f=
ile-description"><img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/a/a9/=
File-upload-screenshot.png" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"1181" height=3D"418=
" class=3D"mw-file-element"></a></span></center>
<p><br>
<b>Example:</b> <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/0/0f/Qu=
estion_example_file_upload.zip" class=3D"internal" title=3D"Question exampl=
e file upload.zip">File upload question type.zip</a>
</p><p>Find out <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/Question_type_=
-_File_upload" title=3D"Question type - File upload">more about the File Up=
load question type...</a>
</p><p><br>
</p>
<h3><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Gender">Gender</span></h3>
<p>This question type collects gender information ("Male" or "Female") from=
 the respondents.
</p>
<center><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https=
://www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:G_Gender.jpg" class=3D"mw-file-descriptio=
n"><img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/7/7c/G_Gender.jpg" =
decoding=3D"async" width=3D"576" height=3D"124" class=3D"mw-file-element"><=
/a></span></center>
<p><b>Example:</b> <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/9/96=
/Gender_question_type.zip" class=3D"internal" title=3D"Gender question type=
.zip">Gender question type.zip</a>
</p>
<div class=3D"simplebox"><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"=
><a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:Help.png" class=3D"mw-fi=
le-description"><img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/a/aa/H=
elp.png" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"25" height=3D"25" class=3D"mw-file-ele=
ment"></a></span> The "No answer" option is displayed if the question is <b=
>not</b> <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/Question_type_-_Gende=
r#Mandatory" title=3D"Question type - Gender">mandatory</a>.</div>
<p>You may also add a "No answer" choice if the question is not mandatory.
</p><p>Find out <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/Question_type_=
-_Gender" title=3D"Question type - Gender">more about the Gender question t=
ype...</a>
</p><p><br>
</p>
<h3><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Language_switch">Language switch</spa=
n></h3>
<p>This question type allows the user to change the language of the survey.=
 Users can choose from a dropdown list, the language in which they wish to =
have the survey questions displayed.=20
</p><p>The dropdown list includes the base language (which is selected when=
 the survey is created for the first time) and the <a href=3D"https://www.l=
imesurvey.org/manual/General_settings#General_settings_panel" title=3D"Gene=
ral settings">additional ones</a> (they can be edited from the <b>general s=
ettings panel</b>).
</p>
<center><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https=
://www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:Language_switch_question_type.png" class=
=3D"mw-file-description"><img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/imag=
es/5/51/Language_switch_question_type.png" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"203"=
 height=3D"293" class=3D"mw-file-element"></a></span></center>
<p><b>Example:</b> <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/d/df=
/Language_switch_question_type.zip" class=3D"internal" title=3D"Language sw=
itch question type.zip">Language switch question type</a>
</p><p>Find out <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/Question_type_=
-_Language_switch" title=3D"Question type - Language switch">more about the=
 Language Switch question type...</a>
</p><p><br>
</p>
<h3><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Numerical_input">Numerical input</spa=
n></h3>
<p>This question types asks the survey participant to enter a single number=
.
</p><p><br>
</p>
<center><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https=
://www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:N_Num.jpg" class=3D"mw-file-description">=
