<b>Example:</b> <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/7/78/Mu=
ltiple_numerical_input_question_type_example.zip" class=3D"internal" title=
=3D"Multiple numerical input question type example.zip">Multiple_numerical_=
input_question_type_example.zip</a>
