-_Multiple_numerical_input" title=3D"Question type - Multiple numerical inp=
ut">more about the Multiple numerical input question type...</a>
</p><p><br>
</p>
<h3><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Ranking">Ranking</span></h3>
<p>This question type allows you to present your survey participants a list=
