-file-element"></a></span>
</p>
<h3><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Text_display">Text display</span></h3=
>
<p>This question type does not collect any input from the respondent. It ju=
st simply displays text. It can be used to provide further instructions or =
a design break in the survey.
</p><p>Please note that you can write in the text of this question also htm=
l or javascript. In this way, you can use this question for other purposes.
</p><p><br>
</p>
