 class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Image_Select_Multiple_Choice_(new_in_5.x)">Ima=
ge Select Multiple Choice (new in 5.x)</span></h3>
<p>This question type can collect input of multiple selections using an ima=
ge. Respondent can click and then the image is selected.
</p><p><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https:=
//www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:Image_select.png" class=3D"mw-file-descrip=
tion"><img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/e/e5/Image_selec=
t.png" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"1158" height=3D"669" class=3D"mw-file-el=
ement"></a></span>
</p><p><br>
</p><p><br>
</p><p>The images must be first imported using the resources link on the su=
rvey settings. Then the images can be selected as the image to use for the =
sub-questions using the HTML editor.
</p><p><br>
<span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https://www.l=
imesurvey.org/manual/File:Selection_147.png" class=3D"mw-file-description">=
<img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/0/01/Selection_147.png=
" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"787" height=3D"777" class=3D"mw-file-element"=
></a></span>
</p><p><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https:=
//www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:Selection_148.png" class=3D"mw-file-descri=
ption"><img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/e/ea/Selection_=
148.png" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"1227" height=3D"933" class=3D"mw-file-=
element"></a></span>
</p>
<h2><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Single_choice_questions">Single choic=
e questions</span></h2>
<p>Single choice questions are those where the participant can only pick a =
single predefined answer option.
</p><p><br>
</p>
<h3><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"5_point_choice">5 point choice</span>=
</h3>
<p>This question shows a horizontal 1 to 5 scale from where the survey part=
icipants can select a single answer option.
</p><p><br>
</p>
<center><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https=
://www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:5_List.jpg" class=3D"mw-file-description"=
><img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/3/3d/5_List.jpg" deco=
ding=3D"async" width=3D"366" height=3D"125" class=3D"mw-file-element"></a><=
/span></center>
<p><br>
<b>Example:</b> <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/c/c0/Si=
ngle_choice_question_example.zip" class=3D"internal" title=3D"Single choice=
 question example.zip"> Single choice question example.zip</a>
</p><p>Find out <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/Question_type_=
-_5_point_choice" title=3D"Question type - 5 point choice">more about the 5=
 Point Choice question type...</a>
</p><p><br>
</p>
<h3><span id=3D"List_.28Dropdown.29"></span><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=
=3D"List_(Dropdown)">List (Dropdown)</span></h3>
<p>This question type collects input from a dropdown list menu. You can als=
o create subcategories within this list by making use of the "Category sepa=
rator" attribute.
</p><p><br>
</p>
<center><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https=
://www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:EM_ListR.png" class=3D"mw-file-descriptio=
n"><img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/f/f6/EM_ListR.png" =
decoding=3D"async" width=3D"344" height=3D"139" class=3D"mw-file-element"><=
/a></span></center>
<p><br>
<b>Example:</b> <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/d/d9/Li=
st_dropdown_question.zip" class=3D"internal" title=3D"List dropdown questio=
n.zip">List dropdown question.zip</a>
</p><p>Find out <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/Question_type_=
-_List_(Dropdown)" title=3D"Question type - List (Dropdown)">more about the=
 List Dropdown question type...</a>
</p><p><br>
</p>
<h3><span id=3D"List_.28Radio.29"></span><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"=
List_(Radio)">List (Radio)</span></h3>
<p>This question type collects input from a list of radio buttons.
</p>
<center><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https=
://www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:L_ListR.png" class=3D"mw-file-description=
"><img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/7/7d/L_ListR.png" de=
coding=3D"async" width=3D"362" height=3D"281" class=3D"mw-file-element"></a=
></span></center>
<p><br>
<b>Example:</b> <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/4/44/Li=
st_radio_example.zip" class=3D"internal" title=3D"List radio example.zip">L=
ist_radio_example.zip</a>
</p><p>Find out <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/Question_type_=
-_List_(Radio)" title=3D"Question type - List (Radio)">more about the List =
Radio question type...</a>
</p><p><br>
</p>
<h3><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"List_with_comment">List with comment<=
/span></h3>
<p>This question type displays a list of radio buttons, while allowing the =
participants to provide a additional comment with their submission.
</p>
<center><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https=
://www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:O_ListComment.jpg" class=3D"mw-file-descr=
iption"><img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/9/92/O_ListCom=
ment.jpg" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"1156" height=3D"280" class=3D"mw-file=
-element"></a></span></center>
<p><br>
<b>Example:</b> <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/7/72/Li=
st_with_comment_example.lsq.zip" class=3D"internal" title=3D"List with comm=
ent example.lsq.zip">List_with_comment_example.zip</a>
</p><p>Find out <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/Question_type_=
-_List_with_comment" title=3D"Question type - List with comment">more about=
 the List with comment question type...</a>
</p><p><br>
</p>
<h3><span id=3D"Image_Select_List_.28Radio.29_.28New_in_5.x.29"></span><spa=
n class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Image_Select_List_(Radio)_(New_in_5.x)">Image=
 Select List (Radio) (New in 5.x)</span></h3>
<p>This question type will allow you to collect single input from a list of=
 images.
</p><p>The images can be added using the sub-question HTML Editor.
</p><p><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https:=
//www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:Selection_150.png" class=3D"mw-file-descri=
ption"><img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/0/02/Selection_=
150.png" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"787" height=3D"523" class=3D"mw-file-e=
lement"></a></span>
</p>
<h3><span id=3D"Bootstrap_Button_.28New_in_5.x.29"></span><span class=3D"mw=
-headline" id=3D"Bootstrap_Button_(New_in_5.x)">Bootstrap Button (New in 5.=
x)</span></h3>
<p>This question type collects single input from a list of bootstrap button=
s.
</p><p><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https:=
//www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:Selection_151.png" class=3D"mw-file-descri=
ption"><img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/0/0a/Selection_=
151.png" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"982" height=3D"150" class=3D"mw-file-e=
lement"></a></span>
</p>
<h2><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Text_questions">Text questions</span>=
</h2>
<p>LimeSurvey provides a number of possible variations of the standard text=
 field. All of these can be defined further using the attributes of the que=
stion which permit to restrict the number of characters as well as the size=
 of the field.
</p><p>Furthermore text input can be validated by <a href=3D"https://www.li=
mesurvey.org/manual/Using_regular_expressions" title=3D"Using regular expre=
ssions">using regular expressions</a>.
</p><p><br>
</p>
<h3><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Short_free_text">Short free text</spa=
n></h3>
<p>This question type collects a single line of text input.
</p>
<center><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https=
://www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:S_ST.jpg" class=3D"mw-file-description"><=
img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/f/f5/S_ST.jpg" decoding=
=3D"async" width=3D"1146" height=3D"105" class=3D"mw-file-element"></a></sp=
an></center>
<p><br>
<b>Example:</b> <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/4/47/Sh=
ort_free_text_question.zip" class=3D"internal" title=3D"Short free text que=
stion.zip">Short_free_text_question.zip</a>
</p><p>Find out <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/Question_type_=
-_Short_free_text" title=3D"Question type - Short free text">more about the=
 Short Free Text question type...</a>
</p>
<h3><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Long_free_text">Long free text</span>=
</h3>
<div style=3D"display:none;">&lt;translate&gt;
</div>
<p>This question type collects multiple lines of text input.
</p><p><br>
</p>
<center><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https=
://www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:T_LT.jpg" class=3D"mw-file-description"><=
img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/8/80/T_LT.jpg" decoding=
=3D"async" width=3D"1153" height=3D"205" class=3D"mw-file-element"></a></sp=
an></center>
<p><br>
<b>Example:</b> <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/9/91/Lo=
ng_free_text_example.zip" class=3D"internal" title=3D"Long free text exampl=
e.zip">Long_free_text_example.zip</a>
</p>
<div style=3D"display:none;">&lt;/translate&gt;</div>
<p>Find out <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/Question_type_-_Lo=
ng_free_text" title=3D"Question type - Long free text">more about the Long =
Free Text question type...</a>
</p><p><br>
</p>
<h3><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Huge_free_text">Huge free text</span>=
</h3>
<div style=3D"display:none;">&lt;translate&gt;
</div>
<p>This question type collect multiple lines of text input, allowing more t=
ext to be typed in.
</p><p><br>
</p>
<center><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https=
://www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:U_UFT.jpg" class=3D"mw-file-description">=
<img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/3/34/U_UFT.jpg" decodi=
ng=3D"async" width=3D"1152" height=3D"220" class=3D"mw-file-element"></a></=
span></center>
<p><br>
<b>Example:</b> <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/b/b1/Hu=
ge_free_text_example.zip" class=3D"internal" title=3D"Huge free text exampl=
e.zip">Huge_free_text_example.zip</a>
</p>
<div style=3D"display:none;">&lt;/translate&gt;</div>
<p>Find out <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/Question_type_-_Hu=
ge_free_text" title=3D"Question type - Huge free text">more about the Huge =
Free Text question type...</a>
</p><p><br>
</p>
<h3><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Multiple_short_text">Multiple short t=
ext</span></h3>
<div style=3D"display:none;">&lt;translate&gt;
</div>
<p>This question type is a variation on the "Short Text" question type whic=
h allows more than one text entry per question. The user first defines the =
question and can then add additional text boxes by adding 'Answers'. Each a=
nswer becomes the label of the new text box.
</p><p><br>
</p>
<center><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https=
://www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:Q_MST.jpg" class=3D"mw-file-description">=
<img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/b/b7/Q_MST.jpg" decodi=
ng=3D"async" width=3D"1137" height=3D"263" class=3D"mw-file-element"></a></=
span></center>
<p><br>
<b>Example</b>: <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/d/d1/Mu=
ltiple_short_text_example.zip" class=3D"internal" title=3D"Multiple short t=
ext example.zip">Multiple_short_text_example.zip</a>
</p>
<div style=3D"display:none;">&lt;/translate&gt;</div>
<p>Find out <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/Question_type_-_Mu=
ltiple_short_text" title=3D"Question type - Multiple short text">more about=
 the Multiple Short Text question type...</a>
</p><p><br>
</p>
<h3><span id=3D"Browser_Detect_.28new_in_5.x.29"></span><span class=3D"mw-h=
eadline" id=3D"Browser_Detect_(new_in_5.x)">Browser Detect (new in 5.x)</sp=
an></h3>
<p>The browser detects question type captures the browser the respondent is=
 using and the operating system.
</p><p><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https:=
//www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:Selection_153.png" class=3D"mw-file-descri=
ption"><img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/7/79/Selection_=
153.png" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"1159" height=3D"112" class=3D"mw-file-=
element"></a></span>
</p><p><br>
When the "use mapping services" is enabled, then there will be a map displa=
yed.
</p><p>Note: To use google maps, a valid Google Maps API key must be insert=
ed into the field available in the global settings of your installation.
</p><p><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https:=
//www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:Selection_152.png" class=3D"mw-file-descri=
ption"><img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/2/22/Selection_=
152.png" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"531" height=3D"823" class=3D"mw-file-e=
lement"></a></span>
</p><p><br>
Respondents can use the pin to select a location on the map.
</p><p><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https:=
//www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:Selection_154.png" class=3D"mw-file-descri=
ption"><img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/6/65/Selection_=
154.png" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"1154" height=3D"474" class=3D"mw-file-=
element"></a></span>
</p>
<h3><span id=3D"Input_on_Demand_.28new_in_5.x.29"></span><span class=3D"mw-=
headline" id=3D"Input_on_Demand_(new_in_5.x)">Input on Demand (new in 5.x)<=
/span></h3>
<p>The input on demand displays one column at a  time and respondents can u=
se the add button to add more answers.
Other options are available. Use the question settings to add more options.
</p><p><br>
<span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https://www.l=
imesurvey.org/manual/File:Selection_155.png" class=3D"mw-file-description">=
<img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/5/58/Selection_155.png=
" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"1159" height=3D"184" class=3D"mw-file-element=
"></a></span>
</p>
<h1><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Styling_questions">Styling questions<=
/span></h1>
<p>It is possible to edit the question layout/design by using CSS. You can =
find more information at <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/The_t=
emplate_editor#Styling_questions_with_CSS" class=3D"mw-redirect" title=3D"T=
he template editor">styling questions with CSS</a>
</p>
